#: docs/guides/backfill.md
msgid "**Ordering rule of thumb.** Dimensions (and reference data) before facts; parents before children; within a table, choose oldest-first when later slices depend on earlier state (SCD type 2, running balances, cumulative metrics), and newest-first when consumers value recent data most and slices are independent (section 4.10)."
